      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My apologies if \"This should not be allowed whatsoever\" came off as a bit demanding and snobby. Someone pointed out to me that it sounded that way. Since I cannot edit this post, I'll just correct myself here.\n\nBut anyways TL;DR, the \"Freeze World Axis\" is bugged. There are so many different ways a World Constraint is used without needing to lock all Axis's. So the \"Freeze World Axis\" should respect that as well.",
